# The gwz-transport commit the transport candidate job builds against
# (.github/workflows/transport-candidate.yml). gwz-core's protocol schema and the
# consumer generator pin gwz-transport's IR export by digest (_OWNER_SCHEMA_SHA256
# in protocol/gwz.taut.py and owner-schema-sha256 in
# tests/transport_consumer/protocol/generator.json), so this commit's
# protocol/transport.ir.json must have that digest; the job's --check fails
# otherwise. Bump rule: a gwz-core commit that moves those pins to a newer
# gwz-transport moves this pin in the same commit, to a gwz-transport commit
# already on its main. This is not the process-global allowlist's
# reconciled_commit, which records the commit that list was last reconciled
# against. The job reads the first 40-hex line.
